     the nose             27.84 ahead, 2.61 below (Wings has a pair 0.22 ft either side; one, on the centreline)
     the belly             5.53 ahead, 6.96 out, 3.35 below: the lowest points of the airframe
     the tail underside   15.06 behind, 2.14 out, 2.08 below: under the engine exits
     the wingtips         13.54 behind, 19.2 out, 0.34 below: the tip's rear corner, first down in a nose-up arrival
